 年种下的。\n\n爱子公主写道：“我希望我们两国之间的这些交流能够作为友谊的象征，代代相传 。”\n\n21日上午，他们还参观了著名的旅游景点鱼尾狮公园。回顾此次经历，他们表示感受到了新加坡的魅力，包括其历史、文化和自然风光，“这是一次学习很多东西的宝贵机会”。","tg":{"media":[{"type":"image","url":"https://cdn5.telesco.pe/file/b0i4ZtoDuQXqQ_hf4uVnvRom8Q0wVoZUKklyspG_qYAZIyFomqkKMdyXYa-R0HRBiyrnNDHlYcu-cXjGh9y6UbOhLlLxhLP-FAybIW60Vb-oCGWo9MzD9vvfJcQB5cXs_GdW2A_dozlWHOUVBMXwpPqo-kcVydGWi1ljTFpibNTGJqxeWoCk2t2xZznx7bl_gOd7Sh-HWCfy8bgZ_JvqdHjwrm7OxUaTPRwvh7hLdd4ghf0Ptia84wyintk1BERAg1Rh_6bd83fJXIFqvaHnZEGx4uqTqTHCkzG63pmctq8-YCrrfAJ0-TO2OMRu_myx0-wAmPg4L4JMUR6tLwKzwA.jpg"},{"type":"image","url":"https://cdn5.telesco.pe/file/GcnsYaz3AwEUAU8VzI35K27ZKy1fAbk2ksqOie8F4E2ABnMv8kEmxJpQPXv1MlIpPH3xfqhGA3GKoir1UuG8wOOTF9gR3bjpOSappaWU4WfoFIvsuygpUb0Ia85wDo8aOl9cWbV5ogXTiViNpiXX1tdLvkRS1kqMszyYTg_1QHhZbuKwqTLBkkTOBMsTy1axuz6xkfZGuHGiI9hQjhky5ag04N8sPdj7ma6rfvFCgyZeXMa5dDrdHHBDl_NZs4LdpGYzKRX8d6k0__zNOqpJ_VPPGW-mXVHtc2vlpTUKe_7kaJrBfKMQNCnY1aQ76LNz8CcFlva2aFVxlK9GiSqF7A.jpg"}],"views":1660,"views_label":"1.66K","reactions":[{"emoji":"💩","count":12,"label":"12"},{"emoji":"❤","count":3,"label":"3"},{"emoji":"👍","count":1,"label":"1"}],"fetched_at":"2026-11-25T16:07:06+08:00"}},{"id":"freechinese:113496","kind":"news","channel":"current","source_id":"freechinese","source_name":"FREE 中文","title":"看这事闹的，本来我都滑走了","summary":"","url":"https://t.me/freechinese/113496","image":{"url":"media/freechinese/113496_1.webp","width":180,"height":320},"published_at":"2026-11-21T17:20:01+08:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-26T02:09:22+08:00","lang":"zh","translated":false,"body":"看这事闹的，本来我都滑走了","tg":{"media":[{"type":"video","url":"https://cdn5.telesco.pe/file/3371966d97.mp4?token=hHy2K-l7XnHRg3kUQHweM4ERTHpU9TbQ6Yb9lVb-kN44qPgchfvRCfVDTavtEuwUldKgqB1Z6F-EDo_4-VYwEmJ99He0sQUDpEJjH6ilo0CCiDPieFxWjws7AInPqzYiz3HwtGcbXWWrpw0j5m6eyg6JtuxiJ3dExRl2fq5kHXj3vF8mwLxrujV5xGmSNWUeluBuI8PtYA14ACWQmzVl34LCZ2ZYbpREJxO2o7mcW2p5pmPXGOV9aAHIq91z-80t3X8RAWC9ncklxivtuJqmw4ZgoLPMPOTRKf0ctFiGWS6q2gciz7jmokFpOZF_myBVVSa9k9bL3wi26uLuayvOEQ","preview_url"